    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-List Fooddelivery Deliveries Historys-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Food Delivery History API provides access to the historical records of deliveries made through the food delivery service. This endpoint allows users to retrieve detailed information about past deliveries, including timestamps, items delivered, and order statuses. It is particularly useful for analytics and reporting purposes, enabling consumers such as delivery managers and business analysts to track performance and identify trends over time. Use this API to gain insights into delivery operations and enhance decision-making related to food logistics.",
